      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْلَاةٌ</span></b>  [a noun of the class of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُبْخَلَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْبَنَةٌ</span>
&amp;c., originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْلَوَةٌ</span>]. One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهِ مَسْلَاةٌ عَنِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الكُرَبِ</span> [<i>In him is a cause of forgetfulness of,</i> or
<i>freedom from, anxieties</i>]: like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْلَاةٌ</span> [in form].
(TA.)

